window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Why choose the lesser of two evils?</i></p> <p>A chance encounter on NYE 2268 has Callie caught between Talia, a fugitive with an unquenchable thirst for vengeance, and Sesi, a gang boss who's always multiple steps ahead. Corporations and cults are on their tail and a bad idea might be the only one left to prove that love can be big enough to save them all.</p>"; 
